<title>NETHERLANDS: Gist interested in Unilever unit.</title>
<headline>Gist interested in Unilever unit.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biochemicals and food group Gist-Brocades NV said on Wednesday it was interested in a possible acquisition of Unilever PLC /NV's Dutch flavours and fragrances unit Quest.  </p>
<p>&quot;Quest has a number of activities which are very interesting for Gist-Brocades,&quot; Scheffer told a news conference.</p>
<p>He said Quest would fit well with Gist's Food Specialties division.</p>
<p>Asked if Gist-Brocades would join the bidding for Quest, he answered: &quot;We will take part. I am sure there will be many interested parties.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
